name": "Image Sequence_004_0000.png", "id": "25726589977040575", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_25726589987040574_4650408330277911466_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VFY7o9tO-PwQ7kNvwH60DkN&_nc_oc=AdoOMOvsngVPtX3qmLWvbd4EJAdy_p5dY4M805RV-9HEeweFYGqWXn9ffXaQsu-AfvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87erdK1-3AcUYgtiNFNS4z-cCeHI1A15dLESs5mUnkxg&oe=6A3FDD07"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Gemini_Generated_Image_q4lsvwq4lsvwq4ls.png", "id": "2120110958738604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302483_2120110962071937_8265361888699801887_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_HB85mggJaAQ7kNvwE8yJUp&_nc_oc=AdqjbzhjGCptK1ajnz0BtrKUEYiK2apxikCInh53s4_834VeknlZNgVX4ExhNvkoCOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8OkXHz9riJjAb0ddYAB217o-eCgEzRlDbpVgKlWMX7fg&oe=6A3FDED8"}, "display_name": "Im A Rascal", "keywords": ["prank", "Funny", "slap", "fighting", "school"], "long_description": "CAUSE CHAOS IN CLASS\nStep into the role of a mischievous student and turn your classroom upside down! Your main task is simple: disrupt everything and everyone. Throw apples at classmates, prank teachers with funny tricks, and make the classroom a chaotic playground.\n\nFLIP THE CLASSROOM\n\nKnock over desks, throw students and teachers around, and watch the hilarious reactions. From slapping pranks to over-the-top mayhem, nothing is off-limits in your mission to create total disorder.\n{931255579317179}\n\n\nDRINK THE GIANT POTION\n\nGrab the magical potion and watch yourself grow into a towering giant! Smash through desks, lift classmates and teachers.\n\n{1667556514258190}\n\nPURE FUN AND LAUGHTER\nI\u2019m a Rascal! is all about hilarious moments, chaos, and over-the-top mischief. Are you ready to cause mayhem in the classroom? \n\n\n\n{648534651686094}", "short_description": "Step into the chaos as 